# This file only documents which secret the Worker needs — it is never read at runtime.
# The real key is NEVER committed to this repo. In production it's set as a Cloudflare
# Worker secret:
#
#   wrangler secret put OPENROUTER_API_KEY
#
# For local `wrangler dev`, copy this into a `.dev.vars` file (gitignored) instead —
# wrangler loads `.dev.vars` automatically and injects it into `env` the same way the
# production secret is injected, without needing a `.env` loader in the Worker code.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_key_here
